# EmailJS Service Configuration
# 1. Create a free account at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Add an Email Service (e.g. Gmail) -> Copy the Service ID (e.g. service_xxxxxxx)
# 3. Create an Email Template -> Copy the Template ID (e.g. template_xxxxxxx)
#    Template fields: {{from_name}}, {{reply_to}}, {{email}}, {{message}}, {{submission_time}}
# 4. In Account -> General -> Copy your Public Key (e.g. xxxxxxx_xxxxxxx)
# 5. Create a .env file and paste your credentials below:

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key_here
